{
  "slug": "claude-odoo-dev",
  "name": "Claude Odoo Dev",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Odoo developer toolkit for Claude Code — declarative state management (Terraform-style), test environments via Testcontainers, and dev workflow agents",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `odoo` (Odoo ERP integration - connect, introspect, and automate your Odoo instance), `state-management` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"manage Odoo state\", \"apply configuration to Odoo\", \"detect…), `test-environments` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"spin up a test Odoo\", \"create a test…)\n- **Agents** (1): `state-manager` (Autonomous Odoo state management agent that handles the full compare-plan-review-apply cycle)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `odoo`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-odoo-dev@claude-community` from `marcfargas/claude-odoo-dev`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
